					accountAgeingInput.StartDate = objRec.StartingDate;
					if (FConvert.GetInputValue(objRec.Inputs, 21) == 1)
					{
						accountAgeingInput.AsOnDate = new Date().GetToday(CurrentData.get().CompanyCalendar).Value;
					}
					accountAgeingInput.EndDate = objRec.EndingDate;
					accountAgeingInput.LanguageId = CurrentData.get().AlternateLanguageId;
					accountAgeingInput.ExtraFields = list;
					accountAgeingInput.Formulas = list2;
					accountAgeingInput.Filters = objRec.FilterSource;
					accountAgeingInput.TransactionFields = list3;
					accountAgeingInput.TransactionId = transactionId;
					if (objRec.ReportId == 500 || objRec.ReportId == 501)
					{
						accountAgeingInput.LoadVoucherType = ((!flag) ? BackTrackType.Transaction : BackTrackType.TransactionHeaderId);
					}
					else
					{
						accountAgeingInput.LoadVoucherType = rDDefault.GetBackTrackType(objRec.ReportId, objRec.Module, objRec.Inputs);
					}
					result = invoiceLayout.GetAgeingDetails(accountAgeingInput, iCompanyId);
				}
			}
		}
		return result;
	}

	private IdNamePair GetCompanyDetail(string sCompanyCode, int iCompanyId)
	{
		IDataReader dataReader = null;
		IdNamePair idNamePair = null;
		try
		{
			idNamePair = new IdNamePair();
			Database database = DatabaseWrapper.GetDatabase2(iCompanyId);
			string text = $"select sCompanyName, pLogo from tCore_Company_Details join mCore_Company on tCore_Company_Details.iCompanyId = mCore_Company.iCompanyId \r\n                        where sCompanyCode = '{sCompanyCode}'";
			DbCommand sqlStringCommand = database.GetSqlStringCommand(PostgreSQL.bUsePostgreSql ? PostgreSQL.ConvertSqlToPostgre(text) : text);
			dataReader = database.ExecuteReader(sqlStringCommand);
			dataReader.Read();
			idNamePair.Name = Convert.ToString(dataReader["sCompanyName"]);
			idNamePair.Tag = (byte[])dataReader["pLogo"];
		}
		catch (Exception ex)
		{
			m_sError = ex.Message;
		}
		finally
		{
			dataReader.Close();
		}
		return idNamePair;
	}

	public TranAuditDetailData[] GetAuditLogDetails(int iAuditId, int iHeaderId, int iVoucherType, VWVoucherFields[] arrDocFields, int iUserId, int iCompanyId, CalendarType oCalType, ref string sError)
	{
		bool flag = false;
		bool flag2 = iHeaderId < 0;
		int num = -1;
		Database database = null;
		Focus.Transactions.BL.Transactions transactions = null;
		Transaction transaction = null;
		Transaction transaction2 = null;
		DocHistory[] array = null;
		TranAuditDetailData[] result = new TranAuditDetailData[0];
		m_iCompanyId = iCompanyId;
		m_objCalType = oCalType;
		m_arrDocFields = arrDocFields;
		m_bLoadCurrent = false;
		try
		{
			database = DatabaseWrapper.GetDatabase2(iCompanyId);
			iHeaderId = ((iHeaderId < 0) ? (-1 * iHeaderId) : iHeaderId);
			flag = _focus.company(iCompanyId).getPreferenceValue(PreferenceCategories.Misc, 51) > 0;
			transactions = new Focus.Transactions.BL.Transactions();
			if (flag)
			{
				transaction2 = transactions.GetAuditIdDataFromFile(iAuditId, iVoucherType, iCompanyId);
				array = transactions.GetDocHistoryFromFile(iVoucherType, iHeaderId, iCompanyId);
				if (array != null && array.Length != 0)
				{
					array = array.OrderBy((DocHistory p) => p.AuditId).ToArray();
					for (int num2 = 0; num2 < array.Length; num2++)
					{
						if (array[num2].AuditId == iAuditId)
						{
							if (num2 + 1 < array.Length)
							{
								num = array[num2 + 1].AuditId;
							}
							break;
						}
					}
				}
			}
			else
			{
				transaction2 = transactions.GetAuditIdData(iAuditId, iVoucherType, iCompanyId);
				string text = $"SELECT TOP 1 ISNULL(iAuditId,0) FROM tCore_TransAuditLog{FConvert.GetSuffix(iCompanyId)} \r\n                    WHERE iVoucherType = {iVoucherType} AND iHeaderId = {iHeaderId} AND iAuditId > {iAuditId}\r\n                    ORDER BY iAuditId ";
				num = Convert.ToInt32(database.ExecuteScalar(CommandType.Text, PostgreSQL.bUsePostgreSql ? PostgreSQL.ConvertSqlToPostgre(text) : text));
			}
			if (transaction2 != null)
			{
				if (flag)
				{
					if (num > -1)
					{
						transaction = transactions.GetAuditIdDataFromFile(num, iVoucherType, iCompanyId);
					}
				}
				else
				{
					transaction = transactions.GetAuditIdData(num, iVoucherType, iCompanyId);
				}
				if (transaction == null || transaction.BodyData == null || transaction.BodyData.Length == 0)
				{
					transaction = transactions.LoadVoucherById(iVoucherType, iHeaderId, LoadTransactionBy.HeaderId, iCompanyId, iUserId);
					m_bLoadCurrent = true;
				}
				result = ((!flag2) ? GetAuditOldNewValues(transaction, transaction2) : GetDeletedAuditValues(transaction2));
			}
		}
		catch (Exception ex)
		{
			sError = "\r\nException RDReport->GetAuditLogDetails  : " + ex.Message + " \r\n " + ex.StackTrace;
		}
		return result;
	}

